s on: grass, sand, water, lava, ...\n\nSome of those terrains have innate penalties or tricks. You will have to learn them and how to deal with them.\n\nYou are about to enter a pond of water; you will not be able to breath inside. When you are in an area where you cannot breathe, an \"Air\" counter will appear on the left side of the screen. Do not let it reach zero or you will die.\n\nNow go to the other side of the pond.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"在你的冒险旅途中，你将遇到各种可以通行的地形：草地、沙地、水域、熔岩……\n\n其中一些地形带有天生的惩罚或机制。你必须了解它们并学会如何应对。\n\n你即将进入一片水池；你在水中将无法呼吸。当你处于无法呼吸的区域时，屏幕左侧会出现一个“空气”计数器。切勿让它归零，否则你将会死亡。\n\n现在前往水池的另一侧吧。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6bf5cfe735362f16e52d92d7f7835eb005b86b7e0a29e69fd30ff22c1e74a95","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6385b660dafd6b41a17ad302c70f9574b88c5ac0727b414b1fdf8f536d22ce3f","logical_entry_identity":"8d63db65c5b6ec1ae7810b36e88c2b9942c024b94da186504eb5956c81976240","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dismissal","source_tag":"talent name","target":"唯我论：豁免"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6c947d7dd746d995dc1ff3e7827685b66a1421f9d95be838a3bdd507986e8654","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6388adb0e533a9c2b1847f6ae3042de1d4a81707f37c58265902a57ba4ea4bed","logical_entry_identity":"1d48ba91caa09ba245a69b2c2b9b16d068c5b1c5a965559f494f0b7ee3ac8a6b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"They're creatures of pure flame, and likely of extraplanar origin, but the ash of objects consumed by their fire has remarkable properties.","source_tag":"_t","target":"它们是由纯粹的火焰组成的生物，似乎来自另一个世界。然而，由它们的火焰燃烧成的灰烬有着非凡的功效。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb2f62547917a223830fd8c10ff53203e0d1a6cdcaaa3afd0430652a9f13c6b1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"638c2fe57a841d48443a1efdd0735067a4e724251bd4a59324de104c372c1e35","logical_entry_identity":"48a35502873268f87ec5339bd040a2c10b12ecda91c12b48e47b262972b6f40a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have discovered Zigur, the bastion of Nature fighting against all arcane magics.\nMagic has caused so much pain and suffering on the world, it needs to stop.\n\nAll your new characters will now be able to betray arcane escort quests to send them to Zigur, granting new, different, rewards.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你发现了伊格，一个对抗所有奥术力量的自然堡垒。\n魔法给世界带来了如此多的痛苦与苦难，必须让它停止。\n\n现在，你的所有新角色都可以背叛奥术护送任务，将护送对象送往伊格，从而获得新的、不同的奖励。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3bd4c335b0ca99a3118de3316bee7264d947e38a5291ac1716d25626aaf49071","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"639271a3f2add70a07162c0aad1cf24370cad60dfd4157daea91948494bd065e","logical_entry_identity":"4ce89fc854c73803f15794954b22498ee9f6bca74464c41e7ddff3f398ea0a9a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is no longer evading attacks.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#不再躲闪攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50a949e5d84a6f0763e710906a9b13eb1405f7ba2caa1b03a5123e3dd6224d57","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"639355d49a2eda5f85f5b9e0fe37639d0d16642e1874bd133c0f22e43fc90df8","logical_entry_identity":"45cf93f3c70b12ba6fbbc7ae341dbb49c04fca7c27d74241939b4dab0f379994","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"They possess the #GOLD#Luck of the Little Folk#WHITE# which allows them to increase their critical strike chance and saves for a few turns.","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们天生掌握 #GOLD#小不点的幸运#WHITE# 技能，可以使他们在几个回合内提高暴击几率和豁免。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b432456ea01487ccd665f197f6ed4ebdb148c0dcc11853a4d202a0366c9b802","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63972fd88fe764be2c1b49a2e845b11135cc86885c958a5e416e66f45442c4a9","logical_entry_identity":"c447b956c6cf7bf1ee7e410397531148ecc8d88e5d3db2b42a4d67ca34719b80","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s will not be automatically used.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s 不会被自动使用。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"06b2d4d558393094bfa386db42c94cd4622738a001cfb4174f927227ed4cf86a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"639d83786013fda5ef38d6177d5c141b1bb1fe91c033eb