 can absorb and the efficiency of the psi gain scale with your mindpower.\n\t\tYou can only have two of these shields active at once.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用护盾环绕自己，吸收 %d%% 闪电、枯萎、暗影、精神伤害，每次最多吸收 %d 伤害。\n\t\t每次你的护盾吸收伤害时，将部分攻击转化为能量，获得 1 点灵能值；每吸收 %0.1f 点伤害，还会额外获得 1 点灵能值，每回合最多获得 %0.1f 点灵能值。\n\t\t技能等级达到 3 时，关闭护盾会将此前 3 回合吸收的伤害（若有）的两倍转化为一个全效灵能护盾（吸收所有伤害）。\n\t\t护盾每次最多能吸收的伤害以及获得灵能值的效率随精神强度提高。\n\t\t你同时只能维持两个此类护盾。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5bc343ad1c438902248215019d3133085e2fc0379a0e14fede60f718c31fe626","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63a76d561a606635413f75a0256b09c307b64e2ea4bbb8269c6c7e76b1bf1449","logical_entry_identity":"52f8290a7d816926c6d3ac960d9f3ebd7d5ae99772e0728e4991fd24ed513a04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Melee retaliation","source_tag":"talent name","target":"近战报复"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}